  "design_direction": {
    "description": "Premium, calm health intelligence interface. Warm ivory editorial light mode paired with deep charcoal dark mode. Muted teal/mint brand identity, restrained pastel metric accents, anatomical health visualization, rounded surfaces and clear data hierarchy.",
