      "Match the supplied showcase composition and visual language",
      "Use warm off-white rather than stark white in light mode",
      "Use charcoal rather than pure black in dark mode",
      "Keep green/teal as a restrained brand and positive-status accent, not a dominant surface colour",
      "Use coral, mint, lavender and soft blue to distinguish metric families",
      "Keep typography crisp, compact and highly legible"
    ]
  },
